        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required when all the furnitures need to be shifted outside from Need To Be?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, the GST registration certificate of the mover, a signed service agreement, a detailed inventory list, and an e‑Way bill for the 850 km transit. These documents ensure compliance with IBA standards and facilitate smooth checkpost clearance.</p>
