        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Insurance is based on the declared value of each item. Our IRDAI‑approved policy covers 100% of the declared amount, with a minimum coverage of INR 5 Lakhs for standard household goods and higher limits for premium furniture, ensuring all the furnitures need to be shifted outside are fully protected.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I get a GST‑compliant bill for my relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment is issued a GST‑compliant invoice that includes the mover’s GSTIN, itemized charges, and the applicable tax rate. This bill is accepted for reimbursement by central, state, PSU, and corporate accounts.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical charges for moving a 3‑BHK household from Need To Be to Be?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Charges depend on distance, volume, and special handling. For an 850 km route, a 3‑BHK shift typically ranges between INR 35,000 – 45,000, inclusive of fuel surcharge, insurance, and GST. Exact rates are provided in the transparent cost matrix after a free estimate.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging protect delicate items during long‑distance transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each layer adds a specific defense: bubble wrap cushions shocks, foam protects edges, corrugated sheets prevent crushing, stretch film guards against moisture, and custom crates secure fragile pieces. Combined with IRDAI‑approved insurance, this system ensures that all the furnitures need to be shifted outside arrive undamaged.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any additional fees at highway checkposts?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Standard tolls are covered by the mover’s freight charge, but any extra services such as overnight parking, special permits, or hazardous material handling incur separate fees. Our route advisory outlines these potential costs upfront.</p>
